{"id":"vezhlivo","lemma":"вежливо","pos":"adv","rank":3242,"glosses":["politely, civilly","blandly","correctly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/64/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%B6%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%B2%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%B6%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%B2%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это и не очень вежливо.","en":"It is not very polite, either.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"\"Доброе утро\", - вежливо сказал мужчина.","en":"\"Good morning,\" said the man politely.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"man"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"good morning"]]},{"text":"Я вежливо поклонился.","en":"I bowed politely.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null]},{"text":"Мы попросим вежливо.","en":"We'll ask politely.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to ask for, to request","l":"попросить"},null]},{"text":"Она вежливо мне поклонилась.","en":"She bowed to me politely.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},null,{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null]}]}